        {
            "key": "cl_faqs",
            "scope": "marketing-sales-collaterals",
            "items": [
                [
                    "What are marketing and sales collateral design services?",
                    "They cover the design of the material your teams use to market and sell, from brochures and presentations to proposals, product sheets and case studies. The purpose is to make every piece clear and credible, so your brand carries weight. "
                ],
                [
                    "What types of marketing and sales collateral do you design?",
                    "Brochures, flyers and leaflets, company profiles and corporate presentations, posters, banners and event material, product catalogues and datasheets, sales material, and digital collateral."
                ],
                [
                    "Do you provide outsourced sales collateral design for global businesses?",
                    "Yes. Our 100% in-house team works with businesses across 7 countries, and the same or similarly skilled designers work on your orders every time, so delivery stays smooth and consistent."
                ],
                [
                    "Do you provide B2B marketing and sales collateral design?",
                    "Yes. We design the full range of material your marketing and sales teams use, all held to one standard and shaped around how your business sells."
                ],
                [
                    "Can you create white-label marketing and sales collateral for agencies?",
                    "Yes. We work with marketing agencies, and because everything is produced by our in-house team with no freelancers or subcontracting, your clients' confidential material stays within our team."
                ],
                [
                    "How can professional sales collateral design help improve sales?",
                    "When your brochures, decks and proposals are designed well and all look part of the same brand, your business looks credible and your team's job gets easier at every step of the sale."
                ]
            ]
        },
